== Effects ==
* Gives an {{E|Eternal Heart}} at the start of every floor.

== Notes ==
* The eternal heart is added directly to Isaac's heart containers, as opposed to appearing as a pickup.
* The effect will also be triggered when the floor is reset (for example, with {{i|Forget Me Now}}).
* {{C|Eden}} will not be given the eternal heart on the first floor if they start with this trinket.
* {{dlc+|a+}} When held as {{C|The Forgotten}}, the eternal heart will be given to whichever character is being controlled when entering the next floor.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|r}} When going though the [[Ascent]], eternal hearts will be given for each floor traveled up.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}}/{{t|Maggy's Faith|r}}/{{I|Mom's Box}}: Each effect/trinket copy stacks granting one additional eternal heart at the start of every floor with every pair of eternal hearts granted immediately giving Isaac a heart container.

